    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junkyard Universe is a 2D Galaxy Cleaner - Cleaning Up the Universe Has Never Been More Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissolve space trash into nothing and make space traveling saver for everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebel against the system by installing a repair upgrade to repair things instead of just dissolving them. Let the results of using the repair particles surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Upgrades and game mechanics skillfully to collect enough dissolve points for your very own junk eraser ship, before the dissolve year is over and your points are reset to 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow pilot Meredith on her search for her lost mother Elaina. Build a relationship with Junk Eraser Ship 3LS4, the ship that returned without Elaina. Decide which rebels you want to trust - and what you want to do with your junk eraser ship once it belongs to you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junkyard Universe is a 2D Galaxy Cleaner - Cleaning Up the Universe Has Never Been More Fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissolve space trash into nothing and make space traveling saver for everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebel against the system by installing a repair upgrade to repair things instead of just dissolving them. Let the results of using the repair particles surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Upgrades and game mechanics skillfully to collect enough dissolve points for your very own junk eraser ship, before the dissolve year is over and your points are reset to 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow pilot Meredith on her search for her lost mother Elaina. Build a relationship with Junk Eraser Ship 3LS4, the ship that returned without Elaina. Decide which rebels you want to trust - and what you want to do with your junk eraser ship once it belongs to you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Junkyard Universe is a 2D galaxy cleaner: Dissolve space trash or repair it. Trade with trash and tactics to bail out your junk eraser ship. Built a relationship with the rebels, aliens and other allies and enemies. Search for your lost mother as space pilot Meredith.",
